Subject: [PATCH 1/2] batch: more than 8 slots with a layer split (8 rows per
 pipeline group), hand-off sized per slot

Measured on 4x RTX 3090 (UD-IQ4_XS): 16 and 32 slots decode bit-identical to solo
(tools/batch_test16.py / batch_test32.py); 16 slots 603 tok/s batch decode vs 345 with 8.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
